**Given: **

Simple Interest = Rs. 192 

Time period = 2 years

Rate = 8% per annum

**Formula used:**

{Simple Interest} = {P×R×T over 100}

**Calculation:**

{Simple Interest} = {P×R×T over 100}

192 = {P×8×2 over 100}

{P}={19200 over 8×2 }

{P} = {Rs.}\:1200 

**Hence, the principal amount is Rs.1200.**

